P enabled to match the new hardware scan.", "created_at": "2026-02-26T10:14:36Z", "repo": "nixos-config", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "f9b5a5c6684e2e46134135798e40ff0fa0c57794", "message": "docs(readme): update desktop environment host mappings\n\nRefresh desktop environment documentation to match current host imports, including KDE on thinkpad and Hyprland on nano. Mark old GNOME-specific TODO items as legacy for clarity.", "created_at": "2026-02-26T09:42:09Z", "repo": "nixos-config", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "5b82088322ec052e261623d5934d1b18128fe501", "message": "refactor: centralize system config and simplify flake outputs\n\n- Refactor `flake.nix` to use a `mkHost` helper, reducing boilerplate and unifying host definitions.\n- Extract common laptop configuration (TLP, power management, libinput) to `system/modules/laptop.nix`.\n- Centralize shared system services (printing, Avahi, Tailscale, 1Password, VirtualBox) and base packages in `system/modules/common.nix`.\n- Remove massive amounts of redundant host-specific overrides in `system/*/default.nix` and `home/*/default.nix`.\n- Delete unused or deprecated modules and files (`gam`, `steam`, `wine`, `swaylock`, `hyprlock.nix`, `alacritty`).\n- Clean up package lists in `coding.nix` and `packages.nix`, removing duplicates.\n- Add `test-configs.sh` script for validating flake syntax and building all host configurations.\n- Update `AGENTS.md` with comprehensive architecture overview, code style guidelines, and build instructions.", "created_at": "2026-02-24T20:39:14Z", "repo": "nixos-config", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "dcc209206e2b6e2e89d05bd3e9a37dbc93c8b295", "message": "feat: add modules to nano", "created_at": "2025-08-07T10:52:34Z", "repo": "nixos-config", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "deb291466a772b88d7749055c