l_file": null}, {"sha": "44a2fc5c48e69c5cf45d4ad6b474365dba9aad03", "message": "feat: add ulauncher for gnome", "created_at": "2025-06-26T09:15:14Z", "repo": "nixos-config", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "d3e214e9e474019505582437e4c4174112643bae", "message": "fix: try to fix prettierd", "created_at": "2025-06-26T08:55:52Z", "repo": "nixos-config", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "f8878ac9e1139ea6b6ab015398c9bf9eddaf3ac9", "message": "fix: remove duplicate", "created_at": "2025-06-26T08:53:56Z", "repo": "nixos-config", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "e52b4b63752e33359c68aff10c5357836bbd1df9", "message": "chore: update flake and issues arising from it", "created_at": "2025-06-26T05:58:23Z", "repo": "nixos-config", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "45cf950c86bbcf2a7f163f068cc4c026906e3ae6", "message": "docs: update README to reflect GNOME-only configuration\n\n- Add thinkpad to hosts list\n- Remove all KDE variant references and switching instructions\n- Update desktop environment section to reflect GNOME-only setup\n- Simplify build instructions without KDE variants\n- Update features list to reflect current architecture\n\n\ud83e\udd16 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>", "created_at": "2025-06-24T17:50:54Z", "repo": "nixos-config", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "62225d451052014a3b42cc080ff87090564e702d", "message": "feat: add thinkpad device and remove KDE variants, GNOME only\n\n- Add new thinkpad device configuration in system/thinkpad and home/thinkpad\n- Remove all KDE variants from flake.nix (thinkbook-kde, xps-kde, nano-kde)\n- Simplify desktop.nix modules to only support GNOME desktop environment\n- Update CLAUDE.md with new thinkpad host and GNOME-only documentation\n- All configurations now build successfully with nix flake check\n\n\ud83e\udd16 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>", "created_at": "2025-06-24T17:45:20Z", "repo": "nixos-config", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "15559635ec0365599c850153863dff75d53af4a9", "message": "feat: add comprehensive KDE Plasma support with easy desktop switching\n\nAdd full KDE Plasma 6 support alongside existing GNOME configuration:\n\n**New Features:**\n- Complete KDE system and home manager modules\n- Desktop environment selection system with modular imports\n- KDE variants for all hosts (thinkbook-kde, xps-kde, nano-kde)\n- Easy switching between GNOME and KDE via flake configurations\n\n**KDE Configuration:**\n- Full KDE Plasma 6 desktop with SDDM display manager\n- Complete KDE application suite (Kate, Dolphin, Spectacle, etc.)\n- KDE Connect integration for device connectivity\n- Custom shortcuts matching GNOME workflow\n- Proper Qt/GTK theming and font configuration\n- Konsole terminal with custom profiles\n\n**Desktop Switching:**\n- Use `nixos-rebuild switch --flake .#hostname` for GNOME\n- Use `nixos-rebuild switch --flake .#hostname-kde` for KDE\n- Modular desktop.nix modules handle environment selection\n- Consistent configuration across all hosts\n\n**Technical Implementation:**\n- New desktop.nix modules with proper option definitions\n- Conditional imports based on desktop.environment setting\n- Enhanced KDE module with comprehensive application stack\n- Home manager integration for user-specific KDE configuration\n- Updated flake.nix with KDE variant configurations\n\nThis maintains full backward compatibility while adding powerful new\ndesktop environment flexibility.\n\n\ud83e\udd16 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>", "created_at": "2025-06-12T18:55:15Z", "repo": "nixos-config", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "c43f13c940a1f0f0c9114174bc9f11263bf480b9", "message": "refactor: restructure nixos-config to follow best practices\n\nMajor refactoring to improve maintainability and follow NixOS conventions:\n\n- **Restructure flake.nix**: Clean up formatting, organize inputs properly\n- **Centralize dotfiles**: Move app configs to dotfiles/ directory\n- **Fix module conflicts**: Remove duplicate config management between modules\n- **Update deprecated options**: Fix hardware.pulseaudio \u2192 services.pulseaudio\n- **Improve system configs**: Better organization and consistent formatting\n- **Add missing hardware configs**: Create placeholder hardware.nix files\n- **Clean up commented code**: Remove clutter from modules\n- **Fix typos**: Correct rose-pine-hyprcursor input name\n- **Update README**: Document new structure and features\n\nBreaking changes:\n- App configurations moved from root to dotfiles/ directory\n- Removed lib helper functions (can be re-added later if needed)\n- Cleaned up commented imports in modules\n\n\ud83e\udd16 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>", "created_at": "2025-06-12T17:37:35Z", "repo": "nixos-config", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "3c7b4301d74bec7e9b3394e39153508fc7319339", "message": "still borked", "created_at": "2025-04-11T20:47:47Z", "repo": "nixos-config", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "37382d7d1cdcb3e91c44ab689d20856e45d742f8", "message": "fix: doesn't exist", "created_at": "2025-04-11T20:24:12Z", "repo": "nixos-config", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "5aee42d7c8cb34a1e7bf5ca0d33efef6ebbd6650", "message": "chore: try extension again\n\nmaybe it works this time after updating system?", "created_at": "2025-04-11T20:22:55Z", "repo": "nixos-config", "file_sampled": fal